   * Link to Google's Privacy Policy: https://policies.google.com/privacy

2. Use of Data

The collected data is used exclusively for the following purposes:

* Core Functionality: To enable the proper functioning of the Application on the user's device.
* In-App Purchase (IAP) Functionality: To verify successful purchases and unlock paid features.
* Displaying Non-Personalized Ads: To deliver contextual Rewarded Ads via AdMob and its mediation partners.
* Analytics: To understand how the Application is used and to improve user experience.
* Crash Reporting: To identify and resolve technical issues in the Application.

3. Children's Privacy (COPPA)

As the Application is designed for children, we do not knowingly collect any PII that would require verifiable parental consent. All advertising is non-personalized and tagged as child-directed. All third-party services are configured to comply with child-directed treatment requirements.

Any data collected by third parties is treated in compliance with regulations regarding child-directed content.

If you are a parent or guardian and believe we have collected Personal Data from your child despite our precautions, please contact us immediately. We will take steps to remove this information from our systems.

